  "notes": [
    "Modbus TCP, port 502. Temperatures are degrees Celsius multiplied by 10; status -1 means a failed sensor.",
    "The manual's Modbus TCP table, read with function 03 (holding registers); the cells shaded in the manual (configuration) can be written.",
    "Register numbers are those of the manual (40001 is the first holding register), counted from 1 (address_base 1).",
    "Written from the manufacturer's manual (in Spanish); not tested on a device."
  ],
